- JAX 200k matched runs are stable (no NaN/Inf, nonzero grad norms).
- Comparison report is updated and reproducible.
- JAX trainer supports required reward variants for target experiments.
- Core tests pass and checkpoint lifecycle is verified.
- Bookkeeping docs (`jax-log.md`, `throughput_log.md`, `TODO.md`) are current.

